8.COUNT SMALLER IN AN ARRAY
Given an unsorted array arr[]. Find the count of elements less than or equal to the given element x.
SOURCE CODE : 
				class Solution {
				    public int countOfElements(int x, List<Integer> arr) {
				        int count=0;
				        for(int i=0;i<arr.size();i++){
				            if(arr.get(i)<=x){
				                count++;
				            }
				        }
				        return count;
				    }
				}
